OL,3,GWales
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FPlenty of
OL,6,Fevening sunshine to come followed by
OL,7,Fmostly clear and dry night, with
OL,8,Fperhaps an isolated shower in the
OL,9,Fnorthern half of the country. Feeling
OL,10,Fcool for many, with some very light
OL,11,Fwinds.
OL,12,
OL,13,CFriday:FA dry and bright morning to
OL,14,Fstart Friday with some patchy cloud in
OL,15,Fthe north. Sunshine perhaps turning
OL,16,Fhazy into the afternoon, but feeling
OL,17,Fwarm in the sunny spells.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
