OL,3,GWales
OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Saturday to Monday:
OL,6,FSaturday and much of Sunday look dry
OL,7,Fwith some warm spells of sunshine, in
OL,8,Fgentle winds. A chance of some much
OL,9,Fneeded rain developing later on
OL,10,FSunday, and into Monday.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
